<title>USA: Iowa-So Minn hogs estim Wednesday 105,000 - USDA.</title>
<headline>Iowa-So Minn hogs estim Wednesday 105,000 - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>DES MOINES 1997-01-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>USDA said Wednesday's est 105,000, Wk ago Holiday, Yr ago 102,000 head. Estimates include generally about 60 percent Carcass Base Hogs. Barrows and gilts were $1.00 higher than mid-session Tuesday.</p>
<p>Trade was slow to moderate for good demand, light to moderate offerings. Top $54.00 per cwt.</p>
